// P3B.2 / A6.4–A6.6, A3.2: implicit mate connector points, on the Top Cap of the Ex2 stand-in
// (`fixtures/pneumatic_cylinder_standin.cadrs`) at its studio position, with a Fastened mate
// dialog open.
// 01 (A6.4) hovering the top face: its points show as dots (the centroid, the centres of its 11
//    holes, the midpoints and corners of its edges); the one nearest the pointer, a flange hole's
//    centre, as the connector glyph.
// 02 (A6.6) hovering a hole's circular edge: its centre is its only point.
// 03 (A6.5) Shift held on the top face, the pointer moved over the side face: the top face stays
//    locked (its dots; the glyph's ring blue).
// 04 (A6.4) looking down the centre bore, its wall hovered, then the pointer moved in over the
//    empty bore: the wall's points stay (its end circles' centres and the middle of its axis, the
//    centre of the cut space) and the glyph sits at the axis middle.
// 05 (A3.2) the triad's relocate drag uses the same points: dots on the face under the pointer.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        Wait(10),
        Custom("fixture pneumatic_cylinder_standin"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("create-assembly"),
        Click(ui("create-assembly")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-part-top-cap")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(30),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("mate-fastened")),
        WaitFor("mate-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(xyz(16, -14, 165.1)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("01-a6.4-face-points"),
        Hover(xyz(28.8925, -24.13, 165.1)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("02-a6.6-circle-one-point"),
        Hover(xyz(0, -12, 165.1)),
        Wait(3),
        KeyDown("Shift"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(xyz(20, -31.75, 150)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("03-a6.5-shift-locks-the-face"),
        KeyUp("Shift"),
        Wait(3),
        // Looking down the bore (three 15° turns), so the middle of its axis can be seen.
        Key("ArrowDown"),
        Wait(20),
        Key("ArrowDown"),
        Wait(20),
        Key("ArrowDown"),
        Wait(30),
        // Fitted first, so the zoom below lands on the bore (it zoomed into the plate's edge).
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        Scroll(xyz(0, 0, 165.1), 5),
        Wait(30),
        Hover(xyz(-4.49, 4.49, 156)),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(xyz(0, 0, 155.6)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("04-a6.4-hole-axis-middle"),
        Click(ui("mate-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(5),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(xyz(-10, 10, 165.1)),
        Wait(5),
        Press(ui("triad-origin")),
        Hover(xyz(-5, 5, 165.1)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(xyz(20, -18, 165.1)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("05-a3.2-triad-relocate-dots"),
        Release,
        Wait(3),
    ],
)
